B.ZG=new A.d6("The Creek Cleanup","Our nature club met beside the creek on Saturday. Wearing gloves, we collected paper and empty bottles from the path. By noon, the water sparkled and the trail looked welcoming again.")
B.ZE=new A.d6("The Homemade Telescope","Kai joined two cardboard tubes and carefully added simple lenses. That evening, he pointed his telescope toward the bright moon. The view was a little fuzzy, but he could still see dark patches and glowing edges.")
B.ZT=new A.d6("Concert in the Kitchen","A wooden spoon became a drumstick, and an empty container became a drum. Soon, pots chimed and cups kept the beat. Our kitchen concert was noisy, joyful, and over just in time for dinner.")
B.ZU=new A.d6("The Seed Exchange","Each student brought a packet of seeds to school. We traded sunflowers, peas, marigolds, and beans. By spring, every windowsill held a different mix of bright leaves and hopeful buds.")
